# Testing

| Change | Test |
|---|---|
| Validators / helpers | Co-located `*.test.ts` |
| Forms / Turnstile / tokens / email | `src/lib/public-forms/*.test.ts` |
| Sanitize | `sanitize.test.ts`, `safe-html.render.test.tsx` |
| Permissions | `permissions.test.ts` |
| RLS SQL | `npm run test:rls` |
| Rate limits | `npm run test:ratelimit` |

Commands: `npm run test` · `typecheck` · `lint`. Playwright is not installed — do not claim E2E. Do not claim done without running the matching commands.
